# OpenStreetMap: never load the Google Maps JavaScript API.
# The Leaflet shim in MARKERCLUSTERER.JS intercepts "osm-shim" script URLs and calls initialize().
# The URL needs a host: Lightroom's URL signer (LocationModule.debugLog) rebuilds it as scheme://authority/...
# Keep the %s placeholders, string.format() still passes all arguments.
< https://maps-api-ssl.google.com/maps/api/js?%skey=AIzaSyDWXF_nF6oEO4gAhLxhTPnY7f5ebkPy1Ek&sensor=false
> https://osm-shim.invalid/?%s
< https://maps.google.com/maps/api/js?key=AIzaSyDWXF_nF6oEO4gAhLxhTPnY7f5ebkPy1Ek_TESTING_INVALID&sensor=false
> https://osm-shim.invalid/?testing=1
< http://maps.google.com/maps/api/js?sensor=false
> https://osm-shim.invalid/?sensor=false
